<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Creation Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the creation sphere make things, or change them: food and water, light and darkness, the skin spells that harden your body, the undead of the necromancers, the druids' brambles and quicksand, and the sorcerers' arts of charging wands and mending armour. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist such spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The creation spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>refit                     no guild teaches it
quicken                   sorcerer 14, conjurer 15, assassin 35, thief 35
haste                     sorcerer 29, conjurer 30
create food               healer 18
create water              healer 16
light                     healer 12, paladin 12
continual light           healer 24, paladin 41
darkness                  necromancer 5, knight 12
continual darkness        necromancer 14, knight 41
animate dead              necromancer 4
leather skin              healer 8
bark skin                 druid 3, healer 16
control undead            necromancer 36
bone skin                 sorcerer 24
stone skin                sorcerer 45
charge wand               sorcerer 15
charge staff              sorcerer 17
mending                   sorcerer 14
repair                    sorcerer 20
reconstruct               sorcerer 31
magic candle              conjurer 3, sorcerer 7
sun globe                 conjurer 18, sorcerer 25
night globe               conjurer 18, sorcerer 25
blinding flash            sorcerer 45
heal animal               ranger 5, druid 13
entangle                  druid 21, ranger 35
refresh                   druid 8, ranger 13
glowing fungus            druid 5, ranger 45
raise skeleton            necromancer 50
raise skeletal champion   necromancer 75
raise horde               necromancer 150
quicksand                 druid 31
mud puddle                druid 8
earthquake                druid 90
mana boost                sorcerer 100
brambles                  druid 12
ice thorn                 druid 17
leaf shield               druid 47
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name (for light, help spell light).
</p><p><br />
